"sec": "02 · Assessing an incident",
"html": "<section id=\"assess-video\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Demonstration</p>\n<h2>Watch: The primary survey</h2>\n<div class=\"vwrap\"><div class=\"vid\"><div class=\"play\"><svg class=\"xicon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg></div><p class=\"vt\">Primary survey: DR ABC</p><p class=\"vlink\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ea1RJUOiNfQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Play the demonstration video</a></p><p class=\"vnote\">Opens in a new tab. Needs internet.</p></div><div class=\"watch\"><h3>Watch for</h3><ul><li>Checking for danger before approaching</li><li>Head tilt, chin lift</li><li>Checking breathing for up to 10 seconds</li></ul></div></div>\n<div class=\"foot\"><p>EFAW · Assessing an incident</p><p class=\"pg\">10</p></div>\n</section>",
