"html": "<section id=\"assess-history\" class=\"faw\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Casualty history · 3-day FAW</p>\n<h2>SAMPLE</h2>\n<table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th style=\"width:30%\">Ask about</th><th style=\"width:70%\">What to find out</th></tr><tr><td>Signs and symptoms</td><td>What you can see, and what they tell you they feel</td></tr><tr><td>Allergies</td><td>Any known allergies</td></tr><tr><td>Medications</td><td>Medicines they take, and whether they’ve taken them today</td></tr><tr><td>Past medical history</td><td>Conditions such as diabetes, epilepsy, asthma or heart problems</td></tr><tr><td>Last oral intake</td><td>When they last ate or drank</td></tr><tr><td>Events leading up</td><td>What happened, in their words or a witness’s</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"foot\"><p>EFAW · Assessing an incident</p><p class=\"pg\">14</p></div>\n</section>",
